WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:56.125 --> 00:01:59.000
-Minnesota has suffered too long without a star...

00:01:59.000 --> 00:01:59.916
-Hey...

00:01:59.916 --> 00:02:02.250
-I will take the leap.

00:02:02.833 --> 00:02:07.541
-You sure, kid? Failure to make the leap would result in falling off.

00:02:08.416 --> 00:02:09.750
-I ain't worried.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:12.250
-Leap! Leap! Leap! Leap! Leap!

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:14.708
-Now or never!
- Leap! Leap! Leap! Leap!

00:02:14.708 --> 00:02:16.666
-WHOA!

